    "title": "Problem 6653",
    "description": "Write a Python function called `truthy_keys_1` that must return sorted keys with truthy values plus marker key \"marker_1\". Practice none & truthiness.\nDifficulty: Expert.\nExamples:\n  truthy_keys_1({\"a\": 1, \"b\": 0}) -> [\"a\", \"marker_1\"]\n  truthy_keys_1({}) -> [\"marker_1\"]",
