    "description": "Write a Python function called `csv_first_row_2` that must parse CSV text and append marker 2 to the first row. Practice csv & json.\nDifficulty: Easy.\nExamples:\n  csv_first_row_2(\"a,b\\n1,2\") -> [\"a\", \"b\", \"2\"]\n  csv_first_row_2(\"\") -> [\"2\"]",
