    "description": "Write a Python function called `csv_integer_row_1` that must parse one CSV row as integers and add 1 to each. Practice csv & json.\nDifficulty: Easy.\nExamples:\n  csv_integer_row_1(\"1,2,3\") -> [2, 3, 4]\n  csv_integer_row_1(\"\") -> []",
